Third-party components and acknowledgements
================================================================================

Device runtime
--------------
  * Tenstorrent tt-metal / ttnn (Apache-2.0)
      https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal
      The Blackhole device kernels are written against the ttnn API.

Baseline / comparison
---------------------
  * gsplat — nerfstudio-project/gsplat (Apache-2.0)
      https://github.com/nerfstudio-project/gsplat
      Used as the standard sorted-alpha 3DGS baseline and quality oracle
      (the "standard 3DGS" numbers and panels in this repo).

Referenced algorithms (math / ideas only — no third-party rendering code is
vendored; the renderer is an independent re-derivation into GEMMs)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * "3D Gaussian Splatting for Real-Time Radiance Field Rendering"
      Kerbl, Kopanas, Leimkuehler, Drettakis — SIGGRAPH 2023.
  * "3D Gaussian Splatting as Markov Chain Monte Carlo"
      Kheradmand et al. — NeurIPS 2024 (the fixed-count MCMC density control).
  * "Weighted Sum Rendering ..." — arXiv:2410.18931 (the order-independent blend).

